  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Shady Grove** (1 other source): Someone fell into the taper's mic stand and gear during this song; the taper readjusted mics and kept recording [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Wharf Rat**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Sally Goodin'**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Revenge of the Tentacle Dragon**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Way Downtown**: back after 71 archived shows (732 days) [2]\n- **Cocaine Blues**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Down Yonder**: back after 180 archived shows (1160 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Summertime**: back after 71 archived shows (732 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-03-03.sibert.matrix.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 27 songs; 175 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-03-03.sibert.matrix.flac16**: taped by Ryan Sibert; source: Shure BG 4.0/849 {X-Y} + Church CA-14 (omni) {A-B; ~12\"} > Ugly Box >> Tascam DR-70 > wav (24/48) [1]. Also: Transfer went from SD to PC, edited in Reaper with fades and EQ, split and encoded to FLAC, with fingerprints and tags [1]",
